# Magical Power of Fire, part 1 (Q615) after Asefa's Eye has seen the thief at cond 2 (the flag is set): the theft at the Udan
# Box is refused, and Udan lets the thief try again by clearing the flag. Expectations replay the reference trace of this
# scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q615_magical_power_of_fire_part1_seen.golden
